<h2><a id="Presentació" name="Presentació"></a>Presentation and options</h2>
 <p>This application integrates and makes easier the process of building topology done bythe <a href="VECPNT.htm">VECPNT</a>, <a href="LinArc.htm">LinArc</a>, <a href="Ciclar.htm">Ciclar</a>, <a href="AtriPol.htm">AtriPol</a> and <a href="TestTop.htm">TestTop</a> MiraMon applications. Nevertheless, youshould be aware about the limitations of this simplified application. Concretely,to do some tasks as:</p>

<ul>
<li>cycling different polygons upon the same arcs layer.</li>
<li>using different types of tolerances during the process of topologybuilding (Node snap tolerance, Undershoot tolerance, etc).</li>
<li>controlling how to deal with multiple records in the attributes database corresponding to the same graphical object.</li>
<li>etc,</li>
</ul>

the user should use the specific programs listed before and to control the whole set of parameters. However, in many typical cases, specially when digitizing has been performed with MiraMon using the tools for connecting graphical objects, CreaTop provides a faster and simpler way to create vector layers with topology.<br/>
<br/>
